Package: lambertReg
Type: Package
Title: Sparse Gaussian Regression with the Lambert Penalty
Version: 0.1.9
Authors@R: person("Bahadir", "Yuzbasi", email = "b.yzb@hotmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fits sparse Gaussian regression using a bounded Lambert penalty
    with fixed shape and an explicit coordinate update. Provides regularization
    paths, training-only cross-validation, original-scale predictions, and
    numerical diagnostics. Fits are stationary solutions rather than certified
    global minimizers of the nonconvex objective.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: Rcpp, stats, graphics
LinkingTo: Rcpp
NeedsCompilation: yes
Suggests: knitr, rmarkdown
VignetteBuilder: knitr
URL: https://github.com/byuzbasi/lambertReg
BugReports: https://github.com/byuzbasi/lambertReg/issues
